agellar motility which maintains the alignment and integrity of the distal axoneme and regulates microtubule sliding in motile axonemes. Specifically targets CEP192 isoform 3 for ubiquitin-mediated proteolysis and thereby acts as a regulator of microtubule nucleation activity (PubMed:29348145)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}